#: scanparams.cpp:516
msgid ""
"<b>Problem: No Scanner was found</b><p>Your system does not provide a SANE "
"<i>(Scanner Access Now Easy)</i> installation, which is required by the KDE "
"scan support.</p><p>Please install and configure SANE correctly on your "
"system.</p><p>Visit the SANE homepage under http://www.sane-project.org to "
"find out more about SANE installation and configuration.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Problema: Non se atopou nengún escáner</b><p>O seu sistema non fornece "
"nengunha instalación de SANE <i>(Scanner Access Now Easy)</i>, que é un "
"requisito do soporte de escáneres de KDE.</p><p>Por favor instale e "
"configure SANE no seu sistema.</p><p>Visite a páxina web de SANE en http://"
"www.sane-project.org para aprender máis acerca da instalación e "
"configuración de SANE.</p>"

